{"id":"Ce083279c638d1d68d886","zh":"轨道板损伤","en":"track slab damage","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"轨道板材料或结构在荷载作用下产生的损伤状态。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":"track slab damage 表示轨道板损伤；track slab 仅表示轨道板。","usage_overview":null,"translation_note":"中英对应依据不同文献的语境对照，供参考。","usage_variants":[{"id":"Ce083279c638d1d68d886","zh":"轨道板损伤","en":"track slab damage","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H1a5227f8195ce1dc1c32","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 陈宪麦等（2023）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D3a4f474506b7bd00c3ce","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"轨道板损伤"}],"sources":{"P120":{"id":"P120","title":"不同累积概率不平顺状态下轨道板离缝损伤研究","authors":"陈宪麦,王日吉,徐磊,潘燕萍,彭良坤,李忠","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20221064","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-damage-of-track-slab-under-different-cumulative-probability-irregularity"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S49d38962ced71774e5ed","source_id":"P120","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"李岩等 [4]基于损伤塑性模型研究了日温场和列车荷载共同作用下的轨道板损伤行为与演化特征。","citations":[{"source_id":"P120","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S3b9f1f6abfa9869239db","source_id":"P120","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"研究结果表明:在轨道结构正常状态下,各累积概率不平顺状态下的轨道板纵、横向拉应力水平较低,可采用线弹性模型简化计算;层间离缝状态下,轨道板上表面将承受较大拉应力而使轨道板受力进入塑性软化阶段,此时可采用非线性损伤塑性模型描述轨道板损伤的萌生、扩展过程。","citations":[{"source_id":"P120","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"ERbba59a720a90ef9c662517d8","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"相关术语","reason":"陈宪麦等（2023）讨论损伤与不平顺相互影响。"},{"id":"C58233bb29c99f4cfea2c","target_concept_id":"C58233bb29c99f4cfea2c","target_zh":"累积概率","target_en":"cumulative probabilities","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C58774e67ff61fc5bb984","target_concept_id":"C58774e67ff61fc5bb984","target_zh":"层间离缝","target_en":"interlayer separation","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[{"id":"ERbba59a720a90ef9c662517d8","tar